{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.offshot",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "收录结束了，工作人员想拍 off-shot",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.offshot",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.offshot",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "歌番组的收录结束了。工作人员抱着相机跑过来，问能不能拍一张 off-shot。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "那，就麻烦您拍啦──！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "姿势有指定吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "text": "对方说：可爱系的姿势，拜托了！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "可爱系──",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "text": "对方笑着说，那太含糊了，就比个「脸颊爱心」吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，谢谢！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "脸颊是吧，明白了──！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……『喜欢喵 pose』──",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶，什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，抱歉……！我在查现在流行的姿势。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "多记几个姿势，遇到刚才那种情况会方便一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "指尖爱心、双手爱心、半边爱心……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "制作人，你做一个半边爱心给我看看？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，这样？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "把那个和我的半边合起来──",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "爱心──！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……羽那，这个有什么意义吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶──？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "呵呵，只是想这么做而已──！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "text": "制作人把两只手的剪刀手放到头顶，说是猫耳。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──这样？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "呵呵，真的诶，是猫──！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "可爱吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎、怎么有点不好意思了……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，那我也来试试。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "猫──！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……可爱吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，嗯！可爱。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还有这个：两只手的拇指和食指比个心，剩下的手指像翅膀一样张开，叫「羽爱心」。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大概是这种感觉……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦，不喜欢吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，不是──！",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "我只是觉得，制作人的爱心姿势好可爱啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不、不用特意说这个……！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶──？",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过这个姿势，名字上也和羽那很配，以后可以用起来。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊，真的诶──！",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "制作人推荐的是「羽爱心」？",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──那，我就记下来吧──！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
